WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:02.900
The Digital World,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.090
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.520
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.250
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.020
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:25.690
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:56.000
We defeated Yuu in the 
hellish realm, Hell's Field.

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:58.700
<i>When they're injured, 
they feel pain. They feel sad.</i>

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:01.430
<i>There's no world you can 
live in without all that.</i>

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:02.130
<i>You're lying!</i>

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:12.990
<b>Beelzebumon Vanishes Into the Light!</b>

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:09.260
Beelzebumon Vanishes Into the Light!

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:16.050
Yuu! Where are you?

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:18.100
Yuu! Answer me!

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.370
Yuu!

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:21.890
Nene, don't worry!

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:23.790
We'll find Yuu for sure!

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:31.620
Tuwarmon, does it really hurt?

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:32.330
Are you in pain?

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.800
Sir Yuu...

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:38.600
Is what Taiki said true?

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:40.870
That this isn't a game,

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:43.130
and everything that happens is real?

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:45.920
That if I'm hurt here, I could die?

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.350
No, no!

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:52.590
You mustn't take those things to heart!

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:54.670
Damemon!

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.150
We must return to the Great Bagra Palace

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.010
and prepare for the next game.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.090
Yeah...

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.560
It's taking too long to heal!

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:10.640
Forget it.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:15.070
I've recovered enough.

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:16.770
I'll be all right now.

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:27.990
To think even DarkKnightmon's 
strategy could be shattered so.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:31.030
The power of these humans 
is not to be underestimated.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.790
But...

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.060
W-Well?

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:40.570
It appears this rose is, in fact, 
the key needed to return to Bright Land.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.740
And, as Yuu said,

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.460
it is directly connected 
to the players' lives.

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:47.810
What does that mean?!

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:51.470
It means that until either 
Yuu or I disappear,

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:53.750
the door to our other world won't open.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.540
What a problem. 
We can't get rid of either of them.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.630
Well, obviously!

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:01.290
We have to go find Yuu 
before it's too late.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:04.190
Wait. I haven't finished my analysis.

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:06.900
I'm worried about Yuu! Hurry!

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:07.990
Taiki.

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:09.860
Leave him to me.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:12.530
Beelzebumon! You're okay now?

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:13.080
Don't move!

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:13.700
Right...

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:19.000
Don't worry. Leave Yuu to me.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.820
I knew it. You haven't recovered.

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:33.120
Don't waste your time worrying.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.660
Don't try to do the impossible 
on your own, Beelzebumon.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:43.060
I'm tired of feeling aggravated over you.

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:45.260
Taiki gave me this life.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:49.400
I swore that I would dedicate 
all I do with it to him.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:50.670
Beelzebumon...

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:55.570
But I'm happy that there's someone 
else here to worry about me.

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:57.910
You idiot!

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:01.290
It's not like that!

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.850
Hey, what... 
Are you okay, Beelzebumon?

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.590
Those two sure are getting along well.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:11.460
Yeah.

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.130
Beelzebumon!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.210
He's still alive?

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.680
Lady Lilithmon...

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.620
Getting angry will give you wrinkles.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:29.750
Shut up!

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:34.170
You did this... to save me?

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.280
It's over.

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:38.920
Our time is over.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:40.290
Blastmon...

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.390
I'm not finished yet!

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:47.260
Being left in this state while 
Beelzebumon still lives...

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.490
Even if I do die, I can't die in peace!

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:53.360
Is that really true?

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:56.330
That voice... Apollomon Whispered?

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:01.440
If your anger is genuine, 
then take revenge.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.990
What do you mean?

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:07.130
I will bring you, the former Three 
Head Officers, together into one body,

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.880
so you can destroy Beelzebumon.

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:14.390
If you can do that, I'll do anything.

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:18.360
If that's how it must be, 
I also have no regrets.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.420
Then it's decided.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:26.350
Endure it, for the fearsome 
negative power of Hell's Field

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:28.100
will now reside in you...

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:30.650
Along with terrible pain.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:34.270
Are you ready, Blastmon?

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:37.120
I've always been ready.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.600
For my beloved little Lili's sake...

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.560
Idiot.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:47.850
Still, you and Tactimon were really 
the only ones I could trust.

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:52.920
We're going to live, Lili!

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.810
This is the last of the 
Three Head Officers' power!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.200
Behold!

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.040
What's that light?

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:07.490
I've got a bad feeling.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:08.650
Let's go see.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:13.950
What's that light?

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.510
That's...

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:18.980
There's no doubt. 
That light is Apollomon's power.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:20.720
Apollomon is over there?

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:24.010
Apollomon can disable the 
program in that rose

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:25.580
and allow escape from this area.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:28.530
Then maybe he'll heal your injuries, too!

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.990
Let's hurry to Apollomon!

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:33.400
We can't hurry... It's dangerous...

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:39.710
That light...

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:41.310
Yeah. I saw it, too.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:43.470
But it was pretty far off.

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:44.950
Let's go check it out.

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:47.060
We don't have any other leads to Yuu.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:47.580
Yeah.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:53.140
Come on, just a little further!

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:55.620
No good, no good... I'm exhausted...

00:07:57.470 --> 00:08:00.370
This is where the light was, right?

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.730
The red sea of death is all dried up.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.630
Apollomon! Are you here?

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:11.770
If you are, then heal Damemon!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.770
He's not here...

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:21.320
No, no! Stay back, Sir Yuu!

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:23.530
The battle is over.

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:26.730
You two are Taiki's Digimon, aren't you?

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.380
Don't bother. We're going back, Yuu.

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:33.030
Don't you know how worried 
Nene is about you?

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.360
I don't want to!

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:37.850
Because, if this is real...

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.830
I...

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:42.840
did terrible things to 
my sister and Taiki...

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:50.370
It's all right. You can start over.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.020
What's that?!

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.550
Looks like I made it.

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:01.320
SkullKnightmon, you...

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:03.720
I won't hand Yuu over just yet!

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.090
What is that?!

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:17.200
I don't know!

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:22.530
Wisemon, the analysis can wait!

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:23.620
All right.

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.940
What? The scenery changed!

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:30.560
It's...

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:33.260
Shoutmon, time to DigiXros!

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:34.120
We're heading over there!

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:37.290
All right! I finally get 
to wreak some havoc!

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:41.490
What is this destruction?

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.330
This isn't SkullKnightmon's doing.

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:51.380
What is going on?!

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:52.740
Let's hurry.

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:00.690
If this works, Taiki and 
his friends are history,

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:04.380
along with this realm and all 
the Bagra Army leaders.

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:07.840
Then, everything remaining will be mine.

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:30.840
What a repulsive form.

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:33.580
Do they plan to wipe out 
Hell's Field with us in it?

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:36.320
Damemon, are you okay?

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.350
I'm fine.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:38.500
Damemon...

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:40.860
Yuu. Use DeadlyAxemon.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:44.270
His Super-dimensional Axe 
can get us out of here.

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:45.990
He can't.

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:48.630
His injuries haven't healed yet.

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.070
We've lost...

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:54.230
so we can never get out of here.

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:57.270
Don't worry. It'll be all right.

00:10:57.270 --> 00:10:59.870
I will get you out of here.

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:05.620
Nobody can escape from Hell's Field.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:06.440
What?

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:10.180
How much of the world must you destroy 
before you're satisfied, Lilithmon?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:11.980
Beelzebumon!

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:17.610
Oh, are you okay?

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:20.130
My hand moved of its own accord.

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:21.230
Beelzebumon...

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:23.620
But don't disappear just yet.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:28.150
I've come back to life 
just to make you suffer.

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:30.640
Let me have a little more fun!

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:40.880
Are you okay, Beelzebumon?

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:44.520
Don't overdo it! 
Your wound hasn't fully healed yet!

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.520
Taiki... you noticed?

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:50.380
Don't interfere with me!

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:57.040
I thought Yuu would be here... 
What is that thing?

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:59.400
Looks like a monster that 
doesn't know when to die.

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:02.070
Shoutmon!

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.430
Digivolve!

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.200
MetalGreymon!

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:06.790
Digivolve!

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:09.540
Shoutmon!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:11.440
MetalGreymon!

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:13.140
Digivolve!

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:15.860
OmegaShoutmon!

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.280
ZekeGreymon!

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:19.770
Go!

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:23.720
You sure are annoying!

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:33.030
Omega the Fusion!

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:37.240
Final Strikes!

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:42.320
Did they get her?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.470
You're heavy!

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:45.680
They did some damage.

00:12:50.650 --> 00:12:52.670
You won't get away with that anymore!

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:55.430
I'll wipe you all out!

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:59.820
Behold my new power!

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:12.790
If this keeps up, the whole 
Field and all of us are...

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:14.660
Taiki! I've got it!

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:15.340
Wisemon?

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.210
I managed to decipher the rose's program.

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:18.640
But...

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:19.840
But?

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:22.150
The roses are no more than terminals.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.950
The true program

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:25.620
lies within the Black and White castles.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:29.920
Unless we alter it, 
the gate back home won't open.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:33.140
The two castles are the real program?

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:36.330
Then if the castles are destroyed...

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.880
We can never leave Hell's Field.

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:43.630
OmegaShoutmon! ZekeGreymon! 
Protect the castles!

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:46.060
The two castles are our keys out of here!

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.380
Right!

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.300
You okay?

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:53.310
This is nothing!

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:57.050
What are you two playing around at?

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:58.110
What?!

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:04.940
Taiki... We need a greater power!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:07.330
Give us X7's power!

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:08.590
Okay!

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:11.100
Help me out, guys!

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:11.810
Right!

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:12.760
Let's go!

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:14.640
We're going, too!

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.730
Yeah!

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:20.300
Taiki, while X7 is 
supporting the castles,

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:21.900
what should we do about Lilithmon?

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:25.640
She's right! 
We need someone to hold her off!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:29.830
Wisemon, how long will it take 
to alter the castles' program?

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:36.230
I'll need time to access the program, 
release the lock, and load the program.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:39.220
So it'll take some time.

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:40.860
Leave her to me.

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:41.730
Beelzebumon!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.570
I'll hold off Lilithmon in the meantime.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:45.910
But your injury...

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:47.830
I'll go with him.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:50.270
I'll keep healing him as he fights.

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:51.490
All right.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:55.060
As soon as the gate opens, 
X7 will destroy Lilithmon,

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:56.270
then we all get out of here.

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:58.240
Got it, Taiki.

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.080
Don't be too reckless.

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:03.620
Here we go!

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:08.950
Lilithmon, I'm right here!

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:14.030
So you've shown yourself, 
you despicable Beelzebumon!

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:14.910
Here we go!

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:18.530
Great Xros!

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:21.230
OmegaShoutmon!

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.300
Okay!

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.000
ZekeGreymon!

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.170
Ballistamon!

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.210
Dorulumon!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.160
Starmons!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.360
Yes!

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:33.270
Sparrowmon!

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:35.550
Great Xros!

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:58.140
Shoutmon X7!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:06.740
A job like this is trivial for X7!

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:09.210
All right!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.290
Wisemon!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.830
Yes, I've already started.

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:15.680
Synchronizing with the castles' program.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.590
Disabling firewall.

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:20.430
Please hurry, Wisemon!

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:22.960
But there's still one problem.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:23.800
Problem?

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:26.990
Yes. In order to deceive the program,

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:29.160
we need death data.

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:31.540
Your death data.

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:33.300
What did you say?

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:35.310
Don't let go of my hand.

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:35.980
Okay.

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:41.010
Stop running around everywhere!

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:47.310
At this rate, it's only a matter of 
time before Hell's Field is destroyed.

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.250
You must escape, quickly!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:53.080
I wonder if we're really going to die.

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:57.500
No, no! You mustn't think like that!

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.790
If I die,

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:03.260
will the gate open and 
save all the others?

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:05.500
My death data?

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.440
If there's anything I can do, I'll do it.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.980
I thought you'd say that.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.340
Are you ready?

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.630
The rose on your chest is 
directly connected to your life.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:19.760
In other words, it's drawing 
upon your life data.

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:24.500
I will force that life data 
to convert into death data.

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:27.650
However, there is unimaginable 
risk involved...

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:28.760
Do it, Wisemon.

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:33.300
It's just a risk, right?

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:34.890
Then do it.

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:38.800
That's the only thing I can do now.

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:42.090
Firewall disabled.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:45.780
I love that look on your face, Taiki.

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:48.080
Endure it, Taiki!

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:56.650
This is a piece of cake!

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:00.930
Taiki, I'm going to 
reverse your life data!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.160
Do it, Wisemon!

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:13.480
I finally hit you.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:14.630
Beelzebumon!

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:16.090
Hang in there!

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:18.200
Serves you right for 
running around like that!

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:22.710
This time, I will end your life.

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:26.810
I came back to life just to do that.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:28.190
Prepare yourselves.

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:30.580
I'm going to make everything go away.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:42.160
I won't lose!

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:48.670
Data reversal complete.

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:53.170
Taiki!

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:54.110
Taiki!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:55.260
Hang in there!

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:56.440
Taiki!

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.290
The gate...

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.090
It opened!

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:07.730
The gate...

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.530
What can this mean?

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.280
The gate...

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:18.300
Does that mean... Taiki died?

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:20.120
Because of me...

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:21.340
We're getting out of here!

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:25.510
Yuu!

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:29.430
No! The gate is closing!

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:30.530
There's no time!

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:32.720
I know!

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:35.230
X7, attack!

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:38.220
Destroy Lilithmon so 
we can get out of here!

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.160
Here I go!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:47.470
Xros Burning Rocker!

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:51.940
Taiki did it!

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:56.740
This is the end of your evildoing!

00:19:58.310 --> 00:19:59.710
Take this!

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:00.510
You...

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:05.780
Do you think such attacks are 
enough to erase my hatred?!

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:23.430
Her hatred for me still won't disappear?

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:25.170
What?

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:26.830
Go on ahead.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.740
I'm going to settle the score with her.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:30.340
What are you saying?

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:33.240
We have to get out of here 
together and heal your wound!

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:35.840
It's already too late.

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:37.080
I know.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:40.740
My body is not going to recover again.

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.390
What do you mean?

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:45.490
So, my powers didn't work?

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:50.090
My life was already over...

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:54.970
the moment I was reborn 
with Taiki's help.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.190
So I'm begging you...

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:01.820
Let me carry out my final duty 
with the last of my strength!

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:04.780
Beelzebumon!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:07.010
Beelzebumon!

00:21:11.890 --> 00:21:15.920
<i>The former me lived to 
take revenge on you.</i>

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.690
<i>But the new me is different.</i>

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:23.970
<i>For Taiki and his friends who saved me,</i>

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.800
<i>and for my precious friends...</i>

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:30.070
<i>I live for the sake of their future.</i>

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.760
<i>Farewell, my lifelong enemy.</i>

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:35.290
<i>Die with me.</i>

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:48.490
Beelzebumon?

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:51.140
Thank you, Taiki.

00:21:51.570 --> 00:21:55.890
Don't forget that I'm with you.

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:02.280
Beelzebumon...

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:07.640
Beelzebumon!

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:09.720
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:13.240
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:13.240
Digimon Data Collection!

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:17.180
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:17.180
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:22:14.190 --> 00:22:15.200
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:16.200
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:17.180
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:34.070
<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:39.600
<b>Sea Dragon Type</b>

00:22:22.850 --> 00:22:34.070
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:22:24.260 --> 00:22:39.600
<b>Torpedo Attack</b>

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:28.420
Tylomon.

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:31.830
Its Torpedo Attack launches 
homing torpedoes

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:34.170
that pursue the opponent forever.

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:36.690
It's a super fast swimmer, too!

00:22:36.690 --> 00:22:39.600
Does it wear swim trunks?

00:22:41.510 --> 00:22:42.830
That jerk Whispered!

00:22:42.830 --> 00:22:45.310
He's using the real 
Apollomon as a shield!

00:22:45.310 --> 00:22:47.050
Now Taiki can't attack me!

00:22:47.360 --> 00:22:48.630
I won't hesitate!

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:50.260
I'll take you and Apollomon down!

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:52.350
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:54.440
<b>Taiki's Decision!</b>

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:54.440
<b>Surpass Apollomon, the Strongest of All!</b>

00:22:52.670 --> 00:22:54.490
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
